M|GEN"]]},{"i":"14:5:20","a":"صَبَّارٍۢ","t":"patient","p":"ADJ","tr":"ṣabbārin","f":["MS","INDEF","GEN"],"r":109,"l":1520},{"i":"14:5:21","a":"شَكُورٍۢ","t":"and thankful","p":"ADJ","tr":"shakūrin","f":["MS","INDEF","GEN"],"r":143,"l":810},{"e":"٥","v":"14:5"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"13:43","t":"And those who have disbelieved say, \"You are not a messenger.\" Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Sufficient is Allāh as Witness between me and you, and [the witness of] whoever has knowledge of the Scripture.\"","j":13,"h":26,"s":13,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"14:1","t":"Alif, Lām, Rā. [This is] a Book which We have revealed to you, [O Muḥammad], that you might bring mankind out of darknesses into the light by permission of their Lord - to the path of the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy -","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"14:2","t":"Allāh, to whom belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. And woe [i.e., destruction] to the disbelievers from a severe punishment -","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"14:3","t":"The ones who prefer the worldly life over the Hereafter and avert [people] from the way of Allāh, seeking to make it [seem] deviant. Those are in extreme error.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"14:4","t":"And We did not send any messenger except [speaking] in the language of his people to state clearly for them, and Allāh sends astray [thereby] whom He wills and guides whom He wills. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"14:5","t":"And We certainly sent Moses with Our signs, [saying], \"Bring out your people from darknesses into the light and remind them of the days of Allāh.\" Indeed in that are signs for everyone patient and grateful.","j":13,"h":26,"s":14,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":13,"hizb":26,"surahs":[13,14],"sajdah":false}